BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Apple Rose Tarts Demo with Alli Keyser-Marti at Gold Ridge Organic
  Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T123000
UID:260717pe4DmujWQkitxQuqqJHi1g
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate apple season by joining us at Gold Ridge Organic Far
 ms for a demonstration-style class on making apple rose tarts with Alli Ke
 yser-Marti. You'll learn the key techniques and tricks\, so you can confid
 ently recreate these beautiful pastries at home.\n\nWhat to expect:\n\n\\*
 A hands-on demonstration in our charming Apple Cottage kitchen\n\n\\*Insid
 er tips on creating delicious apple pastries\\*Tasting of the finished pro
 duct\n\n\\*A scenic ride from our Farm Shop to the Apple Cottage in our ap
 ple-themed trolley\n\n\\*10% off all Farm Shop purchases on the day of the
  workshop\n\nAlli Keyser-Marti worked as a pastry chef trained in Michelin
 -starred restaurants in Sonoma County. Her expertise extends beyond pastry
  to cheese — she's a Certified Cheese Professional® and an ACS Certifie
 d Cheese Sensory Evaluator®. In 2023\, she judged cheese for the Good Foo
 d Awards. You'll find her at Gold Ridge Organic Farms pairing cheese\, oli
 ve oil\, and apples with the same precision she brings to the kitchen.\n\n
 We do our best to run every class as scheduled. If we don't reach minimum 
 enrollment\, we'll notify you at least 24 hours in advance and offer a ful
 l refund.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/615242/appl
 e-rose-tarts-demo-with-alli-keyser-marti
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
