 w to the game\, our bocce pros will be on hand to teach the basics and he
 lp you sharpen your skills. Gather your team or come solo & we’ll partn
 er you up\, enjoy some friendly competition\, and soak in the estate views
 . We’ll provide some nibbles to fuel the competition and a by the glass
 /bottle special throughout the event.\n\nPrizes for the 1st and 2nd place
