UID:2607033msH34Mg3kywBK6mt3beKw
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Friday\, July 24 from 5:30–8:00pm for our next 
 Pour \\+ Explore: Sonoma Valley. Perched above the rolling hills and viney
 ards of Sonoma Valley\, the stunning Ram’s Gate Winery provides an unf
 orgettable setting for this relaxed walk-around tasting celebrating the di
 stinctive wines and winemaking heritage of the Sonoma Valley AVA. Meet rep
 resentatives from acclaimed Sonoma Valley wineries as you sip a curated se
 lection of wines and enjoy complimentary light appetizers prepared by the 
 Ram’s Gate culinary team in one of Sonoma County’s most picturesque se
 ttings. The evening will also feature live music from Jacob Philip Bennin
 g\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a summer evening in wine country.\
 n\nPresented by Sonoma County Vintners in collaboration with Sommelier Chr
 istopher Sawyer\, this thoughtfully curated evening offers an opportunity 
 to experience the beauty\, character\, and exceptional wines that have mad
 e Sonoma Valley one of California’s most celebrated wine regions.
LOCATION:Ram's Gate Winery
