BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:THE UNAUTHORIZED ROLLING STONES
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T235900
UID:260701lYcExtwjQEePwePtBdU5vA
DESCRIPTION:THE UNAUTHORIZED ROLLING STONES\n\nCelebrating 25 years of cha
 os and chemistry Rudy Colombini & The Unauthorized Rolling Stones turn eve
 ry room electric — detonating a full-contact rock & roll experience.\n\n
 Since 2001\, Rudy Colombini & The Unauthorized Rolling Stones have deliver
 ed a full-throttle Rolling Stones concert experience\, lighting up stages 
 world-wide with the raw power\, danger\, and electricity that define true 
 rock & roll. In 2026\, the band marks 25 years of shaking rooms\, rattling
  speakers\, and keeping\n\nthe spirit of classic rock very much alive. At 
 the center is Rudy Colombini — a frontman with explosive charisma\, razo
 r-sharp instincts\, and total\n\ncommand of the stage\, channeling the con
 fidence\, movement\, and reckless abandon that made rock icons immortal. H
 aving studied the Stones live for decades\, Colombini doesn’t imitate\, 
 he inhabits the role\, driving a show that feels authentic\, massive\, and
  alive.\n\n“This is a big show\,” says Colombini. “A real rock & rol
 l event.”\n\nAfter 25 years\, The Unauthorized Rolling Stones remain the
  closest thing to the real deal — loud\, fearless\, and unforgettable.\n
 \nHaving shared the stage and opened for 30+ household names such as: Elto
 n John\, Journey\, Train\, and Chaka Khan! It's a show you don't want to m
 iss!
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://wl.eventim.us/event/the-unauthorized-rolling-stones/695443?aff
 lky=MysticTheatre
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
