DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T200000
UID:260722JiUaws-V1EuKwMZzEJE4Zg
DESCRIPTION:Free\, family friendly event celebrating Vallejo's 175th anniv
 ersary.\n\nThe Vallejo waterfront is your destination for interactive expe
 riences\, family fun\, and hands-on activities throughout the day. Highlig
 hts include\, live Sumo wrestling\, mechanical bull rides\, primetime mobi
 le golf simulator\, soccer & sports zone\, yoga with BlackFULLness\, sound
  bath with I Maintain\, waterfront seating and scenic views\, family-frien
 dly activities​\n\nDowntown will transform into a vibrant cultural distr
 ict filled with live entertainment\, local artists\, international cuisine
 \, global marketplace\, and community experiences. Featured experiences:\
 n\nDJs and live music throughout the day\, Art & Culture Street Gallery\, 
 featuring Jacalyn Eyvonne Poet Laureate Emeritus of Vallejo\; Gail Byrdson
 g\; and Myla J.\n\nFull day of live music and entertainment\, featuring Ak
 il the Big Deal\, candid!\, Cuadra Efectiva\, DJ Jack Nas\, DJ Shaadie\, D
 J SoFresh\, Dozee\, HOF JAE\, Hous3\, and RichMusiq\n\nChess matches & wor
 kshops with Black Men's Chess League\, free haircuts by Smib Smooth Cuts\,
  free hair braiding by Lex's Treehouse\, international food court\, local 
 makers and merchants.
LOCATION:Barbara Kondylis Waterfront Green and 200 block of Georgia Street
URL:https://www.707week.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
