BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Cat Adoptions - Petsmart award to Community Cat Advocates
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T130000
UID:260722gvWxhcZBikKYwrj8U661ow
DESCRIPTION:Adoption event: 10 a.m. – 1 p.m. Award presentation: 11
  a.m. – 11:30 a.m. \n\nCommunity Cat Advocates will be presented wi
 th $10\,000 worth of Treats Rewards points with an in-store celebration 
 and free adoption event\, further connecting pets with loving homes. T
 he community is invited to come and find their perfect companion\, with
  PetSmart covering the adoption fees. Additionally\, the first 50 cus
 tomers at the event will receive a complimentary goodie bag from PetSmar
 t with treats\, toys and more.\n\nCalifornia resident Jessica Rangel ha
 s won PetSmart’s Treats Rewards Super giveaway\, choosing Communit
 y Cat Advocates to receive the companion prize of 5 million Treats Re
 wards points worth $10\,000 in savings. Jessica herself was awarded 1 
 million Treats Rewards worth $2\,000 in savings.  \n\nCommunity Cat Adv
 ocates statement: “Community Cat Advocates is honored to be the recipien
 t of the companion prize of 5 million Treats Rewards points. The efforts
  of our hard-working volunteers have created a long-lasting impact on so
  many lives in the community which is why we want to use this amazing oppo
 rtunity to give back and supply a food pantry for our local Humane Society
 : Humane Society of the North Bay. Community Cat Advocates will also be ab
 le to provide our foster cats with food and supplies. This generous gift w
 ill allow our current funds to be utilized for spay\, neuter and other m
 edical needs for community cats.”
LOCATION:PetSmart
URL:https://www.communitycatadvocates.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
