 ern food\, a full bar\, and a free Shisha tent \\(21\\+\\). Highlights inc
 lude Sirens After Dark Fire Show on Saturday and the Bellydancer of the Un
 iverse Regional Competition on Sunday. Festival hours vary by day. Admissi
