UID:260612RAN8fk-qBUyWHVm2pNJc0g
DESCRIPTION:The ONLY band that can take you back to 1969 and give you the 
 experience of SEEING Led Zeppelin right in front of you\, coming to Sebast
 opol\, July 25th.\n\nDon't miss this opportunity to see the only band with
  the equipment\, attitude and musicianship of Led Zeppelin straight out of
  1969.  Legend Zeppelin doesn't give you a playlist of hits\, they demonst
 rate the same sonic assault of Led Zeppelin in their earliest tours of 196
 9. \n\nCome see something no band has ever attempted\; to journey through 
 the career of Led Zeppelin from the beginnings of 1969 and progress to 198
 0 over a six year period of time.  Re-live the birth of your favorite song
 s into the set\, the development of stage show and swagger as it all grows
  to an ultimate 1980 US tour that never was. \n\nThe world's first and onl
 y Bootleg Band - Legend Zeppelin.\n\nWelcome Back\, 1969.\n\n\\#bootleg \\
 #livemusic \\#ledzeppelin \\#ledzeppelinlive \\#1969
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108090306?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
