DESCRIPTION:D.A.M. Fun Tasting Dan Kosta • Adam Lee • Morét Brealynn\
 n\nJoin Dan\, Adam\, and Morét for a lively afternoon of great wine\, can
 did conversation\, behind-the-scenes stories\, and more than a few strong 
 Pinot Noir opinions.\n\nThroughout the tasting\, each host will take a tur
 n in the D.A.M. Hot Seat\, answering unscripted questions from the other t
 wo — and from the audience. Wine\, business\, vineyards\, travel\, succe
 sses\, failures\, and stories that may or may not have been told before ar
 e all fair game.\n\nEnjoy a selection of wines\, light bites\, plenty of l
 aughs\, and an afternoon with three friends who have spent their careers s
 haping the wine world.\n\nSaturday\, July 25 2:00 PM – 5:00 PM Grand Cru
  Custom Crush | Windsor\, CA Tickets: $25\n\nCome thirsty. Bring your ques
 tions. Get ready for a D.A.M. Fun afternoon.
LOCATION:Grand Cru Custom Crush
URL:https://moretbrealynnwines.com/wine/damfuntasting
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
