 w spent the last 5 years touring solo in the USA and Brasil honing his cra
 ft as a solo artist. He delivers a show unequaled as an acoustic singer-so
 ngwriter\, a one man band style show with foot percussion\, acoustic guita
 r\, electric guitar and the harmonica\, or accompanied by a band. Matthew 
 invites you to come be a witness to nothing less than an awakening.\n\nMus
 ic Associations: \n\nLita Ford\, Blue Oyster Cult\, Los Lonely Boys\,\n\nI
 an Moore\, Derek St. Holmes\, Michael Allman\,\n\nSaving Abel\, Lit\, Temp
 erance Movement\,\n\nCalifornia Honeydrops\, Puddle of Mudd\, Jackyl\,\n\n
 Matt Jaffe\, J & The Causeways\n\nProducers & Studios:\n\nMichael Lattanzi
  - Lattitude Studios South \\(Nashville\\) \n\nChris Mara - Welcome to 197
 9 Studio \\(Nashville\, TN\\)\n\nKenny Kranzow - Mystic Ground Studios \\(
 Dallas\, TX\\)\n\nBart Rose - Fort Worth Sound \\(Fort Worth\, TX\\)\n\nMi
 chael Hersh - Studio 333 \\(Oakland\, CA & Tyler\, TX\\)
