DESCRIPTION:Looking for a unique experience? Join us for the 6th Annual Re
 ptile and Oddity Expo Fundraiser.\n\nWe will have a large selection of sna
 kes\, lizards\, tarantulas\, amphibians\, and all the necessary supplies y
 ou will need including cages\, bowls\, hides\, lights and more for your pe
 rfect set up!\n\nWe will also have a unique assortment of plants including
  carnivorous and bioactive set ups along with a great selection of reputab
 le breeders to purchase reptiles on site and to answer all your questions 
 and needs.\n\nIT GETS BETTER!!\n\nWe also have unique vendors selling one 
 of a kind handmade items from taxidermy to artistic displays\, horror them
 ed soaps\, bath bombs\, jewelry and SO MUCH MORE!\n\nCome and join us for 
 an amazing experience that you can only get at the Vallejo Reptile & Oddit
 ies Expo!\n\nOUR COLD BLOODED FRIENDS LOVE THE HEAT\, BUT YOU MAY NOT.. SO
  PLEASE DRESS ACCORDINGLY.\n\nTickets will be available at the door and on
 line.\n\nAll profits from ticket sales will benefit JnW Reptile Rescue. \\
 (a501c3non-profit 45-0539904\n\nThis is our biggest fundraiser of the year
 \, so know that your ticket purchase is helping to finance vet visits and 
 other costs associated with taking care of all the rescues that come in.
