 f Sonoma County – Saturday\, July 25th.\n\nCome join us for a fun and ed
 ucational event at Montgomery Village in the Courtyard hosted by Childr
 en’s Museum of Sonoma County on Saturday\, July 25th. Enjoy a morning o
 f hands-on\, engaging programming where kids will explore and learn throug
 h play.\n\nThis event will take place at the Montgomery Village Courtyard\
 , in the outdoor area in front of Cupcake Children’s Boutique and Kaleid
 oscope Toys. Recommended for ages 4\\+. Space is limited\, please reserve 
