UID:260722oOkJEsxNr0OXtxV_x1HagA
DESCRIPTION:Attention all Beatles fans in the San Francisco Bay Area! Get 
 ready to experience the magic of the Beatles live on stage with Hey Jude\,
  an exciting Beatles tribute band. With their remarkable talent\, great ha
 rmonies\, and passion for the music of the Beatles\, Hey Jude will take yo
 u on a journey through the timeless classics that defined a generation. Fr
 om "Hey Jude" to "Let it Be"\, every song is performed with accuracy and e
 nergy that will have you dancing and singing along.\n\nTheir electrifying 
 performances will transport you back in time to the golden era of the Beat
 les and leave you feeling nostalgic and uplifted. Whether you're a lifelon
 g fan or discovering the Beatles for the first time\, Hey Jude is the perf
 ect way to experience the music that changed the world.\n\nFood: Lasagna c
 on Amore- Chef Massimo from Italy and wife Sonia\, will be serving sumptuo
 us Lasagna Bolognese and tantalizing Lasagna Pesto\, along with Italian Me
 atballs in marinara sauce\, caprese salad\, and authentic Italian desserts
 .
