 opol Subud Hall\, 234 Hutchins Ave.\, Sebastopol\n\nSirens Fest returns fo
 r three days of music\, dance\, culture\, and community. Friday features w
 orkshops in Oriental Bellydance\, Fusion\, Folkloric\, Dumbek\, Burlesque\
 , and more. Saturday and Sunday offer nonstop performances\, live Egyptian
 \, Turkish\, Kurdish\, Lebanese\, and Arabic music\, vendors\, Middle East
 ern food\, a full bar\, and a free Shisha tent \\(21\\+\\). Highlights inc
 lude Sirens After Dark Fire Show on Saturday and the Bellydancer of the Un
 iverse Regional Competition on Sunday. Festival hours vary by day. Admissi
