SUMMARY:Nature Walk at Eagle Rock
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T110000
UID:260713S7vP5F4XAEu8m9iv7YjPjA
DESCRIPTION:Directions:\n\nMeet at the Eagle Rock Trail at the end of Del 
 Haro Way. From Hwy 101 in San Rafael\, take the Freitas Pkwy exit west\, t
 urn left onto Las Gallinas Dr\, right onto Nova Albion Way \, right onto G
 olden Hinde Blvd\, and right onto Del Haro Way. Meet at t he Eagle Rock Tr
 ail at the end of the road.\n\nSponsor: Parks\n\nAccommodation Information
 : If you are a person with a disability and require an accommodation to pa
 rticipate in a County program\, service\, or act ivity\, requests may be m
 ade by calling 415-473-4381 \\(Voice\\)\, Dial 711 for CA Relay\, or by su
 bmitting a\n\nDisability Accommodation Request\n\nat least five business d
 ays in advance of the event. We will do our best to fulfill requests recei
 ved with less than five business days' notice. Copies of documents are ava
 ilable in alternative formats upon request.\n\nJoin our Rangers for a guid
 ed hi ke along the Eagle Rock Trail. Explore local plants\, wildlife\, and
  rec ent restoration efforts while enjoying views from one of the prese rv
 e's standout routes. The hike covers up to three mile s on uneven terrain\
 , with a steady uphill first half and downhill return. Distance may vary b
 ased on conditions and group pace. Appropria te for all ages. No pets are 
 allowed\, except for service animals. Dress in layers and wear sturdy shoe
 s. Adverse weather or poor air quality may cancel. Call \\(415\\) 473-2816
  two hours before the event to confirm the status. Registration is require
 d.\n\nContac t:\n\nMichala Roan\n\nand\n\nShannon Muell er
LOCATION:Terra Linda
URL:https://www.marincounty.gov/county-marin-calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
