BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sunset Socials at Montgomery Village
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T190000
UID:260715OIJN7WzZiE23Jr6ndKTTFg
DESCRIPTION:Every month this summer | The Terrace at Fieldwork\n\nSunset S
 ocials is our monthly summer gathering at The Terrace\, a relaxed\, come-a
 s-you-are evening where neighbors can slow down\, connect\, and enjoy ever
 ything that makes this community worth celebrating. Grab a table or a seat
  by the fire pit\, order food and drinks from Fieldwork\, located right n
 ext door\, and settle in for an evening of live music from local musician 
 Hannah Jern-Miller while the sun goes down. Browse handmade goods and cura
 ted finds from local vendors\, and enjoy kids’ activities for the little
  ones hosted by The Zones\, a local nonprofit youth center.\n\nPlus\, Sag
 e B Willow Farm will be on site with fresh\, pesticide-free seasonal bloom
 s from their Sebastopol flower farm. $25 Farm Bunches \\(wrapped and ready
 \\) are available for pre order here and can be picked up at the event. 
 You can also mix and match your favorites\, or let us help you put togethe
 r a beautiful bouquet of dahlia stems and seasonal flowers for $2.00 per d
 ahlia while supplies last.\n\nOrder in Advance Recommended\n\nThis event i
 s free and open to the public. No registration needed.\n\nJoin us for Suns
 et Socials on Thursday\, July 30th. Come early\, stay late\, and bring th
 e whole family. Even furry friends are welcome at The Terrace.\n\nCan’t 
 make it in July? Our next event is scheduled for Thursday\, August 27th.
LOCATION:Fieldwork
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/sunset-socials-at-montgomery-vil
 lage/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
