UID:260627lROeO4Yjd0WtIw8vpBqlhQ
DESCRIPTION:Date & Time\n\nThursday\, July 30\, 2026\n\n7:00 PM – 9:00 P
 M\n\nLocation\n\nBack Patio\n\nCategory\n\nCulinary Arts\, Dance\, Summer 
 at the Center\n\nExperience Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n21 and older\n\
 nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$40\n\nTransport yourself to Spain for an unf
 orgettable evening of culture\, flavor\, music\, and film. “A Night in S
 pain” invites you to experience the passion and artistry of Spanish trad
 ition through an immersive flamenco lesson and live demonstration\, where 
 you’ll learn the rhythms\, movement\, and spirit behind this iconic danc
 e.Enjoy a delicious tapas and sangria experience prepared by Chef Gerardo\
 , who will guide you through the flavors and techniques of classic Spanish
  small plates.This night will recreate the vibrant\, romantic\, passionate
 \, colorful\, energy of Spain.  Perfect for date night\, friends\, or any
 one looking to explore something new\, this experience blends dance\, food
 \, wine\, and connection into one magical evening.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/night-in-spain/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
