 h. Using flowers and natural dye materials\, you'll create one-of-a-kind p
 atterns on silk through the traditional process of bundle dyeing.\n\nIn th
 is workshop you'll:\n\n• Learn the fundamentals of botanical bundle dyei
 ng\n\n• Create one-of-a-kind designs using flowers and natural dyes\n\n
 • Explore color\, pattern\, and botanical design\n\nTake home two hand-d
 yed silk scarves in different sizes.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
