DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T140000
UID:260709pSMXjtn4u0u-8wN-5qsvNA
DESCRIPTION:Community Clothing Swap @ Art Escape\n\nJoin us for a relaxed\
 , drop-in clothing swap this summer at Art Escape!\n\nBring clothes you no
  longer wear\, set them out on our tables or tarps\, and swap them for som
 ething new-to-you. No registration needed—and you don’t have to bring 
 anything to participate.\n\nInside\, we’ll also have a DIY Mending & Pat
 ch Bar \\+ Dye Station open all day. Fix\, alter\, or customize your swapp
 ed items with sewing machines\, supplies\, and help from experienced sewis
 ts—all free of charge \\(donations welcome\\).\n\nHow it works:\n\nDrop 
 in and check in at the entrance\n\nSet out your clothing\n\nBrowse and swa
 p freely\n\nHead upstairs to mend\, patch\, or personalize your finds\n\nW
 hy come? It’s a fun\, easy way to build community\, refresh your wardrob
 e\, and keep clothing out of landfills by giving it a second life.
LOCATION:Art Escape
URL:https://artescapesonoma.jumbula.com/Summer2026/WearShareRepairCLOTHING
 SWAP
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
