 summer from 1:00 PM - 3:00 PM. Each week will feature a live music perform
 ance from a local band or performer. Not to be confused with Tuesdays in t
 he Plaza\, this is a great opportunity to bring a picnic\, sit back\, rela
 x and enjoy the melodies.\n\nAbout the music: Nate Lopez delivers a sound 
