SUMMARY:MOVIE MONDAY DOWNTOWN SANTA ROSA: Explorers (1985)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260803T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260803T160000
UID:260605Uqsx7q1-w0ymfcll0Rs63w
DESCRIPTION:MOVIE MONDAY DOWNTOWN SANTA ROSA: Explorers  Featuring young E
 than Hawke and River Phoenix\, this beloved 80s adventure was filmed in Pe
 taluma\, bringing big dreams to a small-town setting. A timeless tale of i
 magination and discovery\, it captures the youthful curiosity that connect
 s generations.  Join us for another FREE family movie night in Downtown Sa
 nta Rosa!  Activities begin at 4 PM  Movie begins around 6 PM  Thank you t
 o our amazing sponsors and partners for helping bring this free community 
 event series to life: Poppy Bank\, Kaiser Permanente\, Keysight Technologi
 es\, Sutter Health\, Dave & Buster’s\, Dax Entertainment LLC\, Stellar X
 P\, Inc.\, and Wine Country Radio stations KRSH 95.9\, The Drive 95.5\, La
 tino 100.9\, Exitos 98.7\, and BOB FM 96.7.  \\#SummerOnTheSquare \\#Explo
 rersMovie \\#MovieMondays
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Dowtown Square
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1006651385095960/
