 ng\, or meet someone unexpected. Some weeks it’s a relaxed breakfast\, o
 ther times a mini workshop or tasting. Every week brings something fresh t
 o the table.\n\nWe’ll bring the croissants… or quiche… honestly\, it
 ’s a surprise. You just bring your appetite!\n\nCurious about CraftWork?
  This is the perfect chance to explore! Meet the team\, mingle with the co
 mmunity\, take a tour\, and grab a free day pass to actually get some work
  done \\(seriously\\).\n\nQuestions about our space or events? More about 
 us via craftworkhbg.com!
