  go beyond the notes on the page and uncover the stories behind classical 
 music. Join Concert Host Michael Adams and the Maple Quartet as they explo
 re how composers like Dvořák and Gabriela Lena Frank found inspiration i
 n folk music from their cultural traditions. For the most up-to-date progr
 am\, artist info\, and ticket availability\, click the ticket link to visi
 t the event page.
LOCATION:Grace Episcopal Church
