BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:GVRD's Bands and Brews Summer Concert Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T200000
UID:260625mM8W2D_dC0C9BbHbLJb2PQ
DESCRIPTION:Summer nights\, live music\, local brews\, and great company
 —what could be better? The Greater Vallejo Recreation District invites y
 ou to join us for the 2026 Bands & Brews Summer Concert Series\, a free co
 mmunity tradition featuring incredible live music\, delicious food trucks\
 , and local craft beer in the beautiful setting of Blue Rock Springs Park.
  Blue Rock Springs Park Food Trucks & Gates Open: 5:00 PM Concert Begins: 
 6:30 PM ️ Free Admission 2026 Band Lineup June 26 – Hey Jude A fan-fav
 orite tribute band delivering the timeless sound of The Beatles and more. 
 July 10 – Good Time Collective Band High-energy party classics and R&B h
 its that will keep you moving all night long. July 24 – Groove Ride An e
 lectrifying mix of funk\, R&B\, pop\, rock\, Latin\, and soul—something 
 for everyone! August 7 – Viva Santana Show A powerful Latin rock tribute
  celebrating the legendary sound of Santana. Event Experience ✅ Live ban
 ds every night ✅ Local craft beer by True Symmetry Brewing Company \\(Su
 isun City\\) ✅ Delicious food trucks on-site ✅ Family-friendly atmosph
 ere ✅ Open park setting perfect for lawn chairs and blankets ✅ Dancing
 \, community\, and summer fun Friendly Reminders • Admission is FREE •
  Gates open at 5:00 PM\; music begins at 6:30 PM • Bring lawn chairs or 
 blankets for seating • Outside alcohol is prohibited • Beer sales are 
 available to guests 21\\+ with valid ID • Please help keep our parks cle
 an by using designated trash and recycling receptacles • Friendly\, leas
 hed dogs are welcome Sponsors & Community Partners This event is made poss
 ible through the support of our valued community partners and sponsors. GV
 RD extends its appreciation to the organizations and local businesses that
  help bring free\, high-quality recreation opportunities to Vallejo reside
