 summer from 1:00 PM - 3:00 PM. Each week will feature a live music perform
 ance from a local band or performer. Not to be confused with Tuesdays in t
 he Plaza\, this is a great opportunity to bring a picnic\, sit back\, rela
 x and enjoy the melodies.\n\nAbout the music: Songs of Lennon and McCartne
 y features Drew Harrison and Scott Southard\, the voices of Lennon & McCar
 tney in one of America’s favorite and critically acclaimed Beatles tribu
 te groups. A pair of top-notch singer/songwriters in their own write\, Dre
