DESCRIPTION:Ten years of this. Ten years of you. 🍺 This one's for the C
 rooked Goat team who've been here since day one\, the regulars who never m
 iss a Friday\, and everyone who's pulled up a stool and made this place fe
 el like home. We couldn't have done it without this community. And we're c
 elebrating all of it on August 15 at Crooked Goat Brewing Sebastopol with 
 the biggest party we've ever thrown. We're going full carnival. Games\, gi
 veaways\, beer slushies\, cotton candy\, popcorn\, @\\_\\_lunch\\_\\_box\\
