BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:KIDS HIP HOP WORKSHOP
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T140000
UID:260630w-86A_DHdUegUgYgSECyJw
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to bounce\, rock\, and roll! Our Kids Hip-Hop class 
 is a high-energy\, fun-filled introduction to the world of street dance.\n
 \nDesigned specifically for young dancers\, this class focuses on rhythm\,
  coordination\, and building self-confidence\, all while grooving to their
  favorite clean\, age-appropriate beats.\n\nWe break down the coolest move
 s into simple\, easy-to-follow steps. Your child will learn the basics of 
 hip-hop foundation\, memory-boosting choreography\, and how to express the
 ir unique personality through movement.\n\n• Fun Warm-Ups: High-energy g
 ames and stretches to get the body moving and blood pumping.\n\n• Skill 
 Building: Learning classic hip-hop grooves\, isolations\, and footwork.\n\
 n• The Routine: A fun\, step-by-step dance routine they can’t wait to 
 show off at home!\n\n• Freestyle Circle: A supportive space at the end o
 f class for kids to show off their own creative moves and cheer on their f
 riends.\n\nwith Shari Chandler\n\nDriven by my passion for dance and conne
 ction\, I create a positive\, high-energy space where kids can express the
 mselves\, build confidence\, and grow through movement. My own journey sta
 rted at age seven in Napa and includes performing in Disneyland’s 60th A
 nniversary celebration—an experience that still inspires me today.\n\nWh
 ile I love teaching foundational hip-hop grooves and fun\, age-appropriate
