 piration from new styles. In this class\, your child will boost their coor
 dination\, learn exciting routines\, and join a welcoming “dance crew”
  where socializing\, creativity\, and self-expression are celebrated every
  week.\n\nKIDS HIP HOP WORKSHOP\, August 15\n\nTIME: 1:00 pm – 2:00 pm\n
 \nDrop in $25 \\(all Ages\\)
