DESCRIPTION:Marin Center presents Roller Disco Daze\, a free community rol
 ler skating experience on Lagoon Island at the Marin County Fairgrounds. R
 unning Wednesdays through Sundays\, July 17 through August 16\, the rink i
 s open to all ages and skill levels\, with themed nights every Friday\, Sa
 turday\, and Sunday to keep things lively all summer long. \n\nSkate bene
 ath a disco ball surrounded by the lagoon\, then cool down with lawn games
 \, explore art installations by local artists on display\, and don't miss 
 the giant inflatable skate for the ultimate photo opp. A DJ spins on-site 
 beginning at 12 pm every Friday-Sunday to keep the music on point and the 
 vibes rolling. Food from Manny's Tacos will be on-site all days of the eve
 nt\, and Lobo's Ice Cream will be available July 17-19 and July 24-26.\n\n
 Admission is free. Skate rentals\, including kids' sizes\, are available o
 n-site for $5. All skaters must sign a waiver\; skaters under 18 require a
  parent or guardian signature.
LOCATION:Lagoon Island\, Marin County Fairgrounds
URL:https://marincenter.marincounty.gov/node/306
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
