 oin us for one final Summer on the Square Movie Monday featuring this icon
 ic adventure classic. Produced by Steven Spielberg and starring Sean Astin
 \, Josh Brolin\, and Corey Feldman\, this iconic 80s adventure remains one
  of the most celebrated films set along the Northern California coast. Its
  themes of friendship\, resilience\, and discovery capture the spirit of c
 ommunity and adventure that defines summer in Sonoma County.  Bring the wh
 ole family for a night of nostalgia\, community\, and summer fun in Downto
 wn Santa Rosa.  Activities begin at 4 PM  Movie begins around 6 PM  FREE a
 dmission  Thank you to our amazing sponsors and partners for helping bring
  this free community event series to life: Poppy Bank\, Kaiser Permanente\
 , Keysight Technologies\, Sutter Health\, Dave & Buster’s\, Dax Entertai
 nment LLC\, Stellar XP\, Inc.\, and Wine Country Radio stations KRSH 95.9\
