SUMMARY:Tuesdays in the Plaza: Banda Potrero (Latin / Regional Mexicano)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260818T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260818T200000
UID:260723othBgfgb9kaNnC6VL3JmEw
DESCRIPTION:Our weekly summer concerts in the Healdsburg Plaza from 6:00 p
 .m. to 8:00 p.m. provide an eclectic and unique line-up of bands\, and hav
 e been assembled to please a wide array of musical interests. Food vendors
  will be on-hand to offer locally sourced food for sale starting at 5:00 p
 .m. with the music beginning at 6:00 p.m.\n\nAbout the band: Banda Potrero
  is a prominent group in the Mexican regional banda music genre\, known fo
 r their unique sound that combines traditional and renewed elements. The b
 and is composed of talented instrumentalists who bring a moving melody\, c
 atchy lyrics\, and an energetic performance style to their music. They are
  celebrated for uplifting the spirit of their listeners\, creating an atmo
 sphere of joy and unity. Banda Potrero's music ranges from love ballads to
  party melodies\, and they are recognized for their ability to connect wit
 h the audience and create memorable performances.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Plaza
URL:https://healdsburg.gov/335/Tuesdays-in-the-Plaza
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
