BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:IV & The Strange Band + Clownvis - downtown Santa Rosa Aug 20
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260820T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260820T220000
UID:260715pa4z2URSv0yLjcUVZpkd8Q
DESCRIPTION:GET TICKETS HERE : **https://www.ticketor.com/.../iv-the-stran
 ge-band-clownvis...**\n\nThe "Outlaws and Oddballs" tour combines the grit
 ty country-rock of IV and The Strange Band (fronted by Coleman Williams\, 
 great-grandson of Hank Williams) with the bizarre comedy-lounge act of Clo
 wnvis . This tour promises a high-energy mix of dark country\, Southern ro
 ck\, and satirical performance.\n\n\\- About IV and The Strange Band: Know
 n for intense live shows\, their sound blends traditional country storytel
 ling with rock and metal influences\, often described as "metal-country." 
 - About Clownvis: Dubbed "The King of Clowns\," Clownvis Presley blends El
 vis-style showmanship with raunchy comedy\, original music\, and celebrity
  impressions.\n\nAge Restrictions: 21+ Doors Open: 6pm Show Time: 7pm Pres
 ale $25-General Admission Location: Barrel Proof Lounge\, 501 Mendocino Av
 enue\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** fo
 r all sorts of good times ahead!
