DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Thursday Night Live series—an ongoing
  celebration of great music\, good wine\, and easy Napa Valley evenings. T
 hroughout the season\, we’ll feature a rotating lineup of talented local
  and regional artists spanning a variety of genres.\n\nAdmission is compli
 mentary\, and seating is first-come\, first-served—so come early\, grab 
 your spot\, and settle in for the night. Enjoy your favorite Priest Ranch 
 wines available by the glass or bottle\, along with a special menu from Th
 e Kitchen crafted just for the occasion. Whether you’re winding down aft
 er work or gathering friends for a casual night out\, Thursday Night Live 
 is your standing invitation to sip\, savor\, and soak in the sounds.\n\nMu
 sic is complimentary. Wine and food are available to purchase. No reservat
 ion required.\n\nJuly 9 — Carlos Ramirez Trio \\(Latin\\)\n\nJuly 16 —
  David Ronconi Trio \\(Alternative\\)\n\nJuly 23 — Sticky Bandits \\(Cov
 ers\\)\n\nJuly 30 — Complicated Animals \\(Indie Nova\\)\n\nAugust 6 —
  Radio Bobcat \\(Indie\\)\n\nAugust 13 — Big Blu Soul Revue \\(Soul\\)\n
 \nAugust 20 — Lilan Kane \\(Soul\\)\n\nAugust 27 — Sean Carscaden \\(R
 ock\\)\n\nSeptember 10 — Edgardo y Candela \\(Latin\\)\n\nSeptember 17 
 — Steady Eddy & The Shakers \\(Motown\\)
LOCATION:Priest Ranch Tasting Room
URL:https://priestranchwines.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
