DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\n**F
 eaturing The Renovators & SoCo Paella**\n\nJoin us for a lively Friday nig
 ht at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in downtown Healdsb
 urg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and bold\, unforgettable
  food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the high-energy\, crowd-pleasin
 g sounds of The Renovators with the rich\, made-to-order flavors of SoCo P
 aella.\n\nThe Renovators bring an upbeat mix of familiar favorites that se
 ts the tone for a relaxed and social evening surrounded by barrels and war
 m winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s wines by the glass or bottle while 
 SoCo Paella prepares their signature paella on site\, featuring fresh ingr
 edients and deep\, savory flavor.\n\nFriday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free ent
 ry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 event inside the Barrel Room. Under-
 21 guests and leashed pets are welcome on the patio only.\n\nCome grab a s
 eat early and enjoy a classic Sonoma County night of great music\, great w
 ine\, and outstanding food.\n\nWine available for purchase Live music by T
 he Renovators Food by SoCo Paella Location: Longboard Vineyards Barrel Roo
 m Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
LOCATION:Longboard Vineyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Friday Night Comedy - Matt Gubser - Downtown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260821T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260821T220000
UID:260717AO0292Vng0q23zSWfOkIfQ
DESCRIPTION:Friday night stand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nVIP TAB
 LES NOW AVAILABLE! Snag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own pr
 ivate call button to summon service\, and your first round of beer/cider (
 or a bottle of wine) for only $95!\n\nEvery Friday night hilarious comedia
 ns from The Bay Area and beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick arou
 nd after for late-night karaoke! Fresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThi
 s Week: Jon Lehre (host) Jason Nathan Jalisa Robinson\n\nHeadliner: Matt G
 ubser\n\n“A true comedian…just a laid-back dude with a bone-dry wit.
 ” -San Jose Metro\n\nMatt Gubser is a San Francisco Bay Area comedian wh
 o performs across the country and internationally.\n\nDiving into parentin
 g\, dating\, sex\, politics\, & religion\, he mixes his personal life and 
 biting social commentary\, all couched in a comfortable\, relaxed delivery
 . Matt was has been part of SF Weekly's "Best of the Bay" and was named 
 “Comedian’s Comedian” in the Bay Area Stand Up Comedy Awards. You ca
 n watch his first special\, "Daddy Issues" on Next Up Comedy.\n\nHis most 
 recent album\, “Before He Was Famous\,” reached #2 on Amazon Music's c
 omedy chart.\n\nHe's opened for Amy Schumer\, Margaret Cho\, Eddie Pepiton
 e\, Aasif Mandvi\, Myq Kaplan\, Jake Johannsen among others. More at **htt
 ps://www.mattgubser.com/**\n\n21+ Doors - 7p / Show - 8p $15adv / $20door\
 n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahe
 ad.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/friday-night-comedy-matt-gubser-downtown-
 santa-rosa-tickets-1990353652353
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
